        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light"><svg class="eyebrow-leaf" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4c-8.5 0-15 5.2-15.4 13 .6-3 2.7-5.6 6-6.7C15.4 8.8 19 7.5 20 4z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Start the structure</span>
